  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Medium Voltage Door Latches</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">The moving latching pins engage the fixed position latch plates. The latch plates are bolted to the enclosure using a stud plate that passes through the flange of the case. The latch plates can be adjusted in all directions using the slots in the enclosure flange. The latch plates can be adjusted in all directions using the slots in the enclosure flange. The nominal position for the latch plate is flush with the front edge of the enclosure flange.</p>

