<div class="page">
  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Isolation Switch Handle, Contactor Mechanical Interlock</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">The Limitamp AR vacuum starter is equipped with a quick-make/quick-break isolation switch in each starter. The isolation switch is not designed to make or break motor load current. To ensure that the isolation switch handle cannot be operated when the contactor is energized, a mechanical interlock is provided between the contactor and the isolation switch handle. Operation of this mechanical interlock is checked per the following procedure.</p>

  <div class="warning-box">
    <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">WARNING:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">Confirm the equipment is de-energized before performing this check.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 30px;">
