  <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Low Voltage Box Wiring Details</h2>
  <ol style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <li>All low voltage wiring entering and exiting the low voltage compartment must be routed through the bushings provided on the box.</li>
    <li>Once all wiring is complete, fill the bushings with RTV or other equivalent sealant material.</li>
    <li>Wrap the outside of bushings and wiring with 3M, 130C tape. Tape must extend down the wire bundle a minimum of 6 inches. Refer to figure 14 for details.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="warning-box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">WARNING:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">Ensure all wire openings are properly sealed before energizing.</p>
  </div>

