        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <h3 style="text-align: center;">Extension Plenum - General Guidelines</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Support the Extension plenum at a minimum, every <span data-field="support_interval_1">{{ support_interval_1 }}</span> throughout the straight length.</li>
                <li>Straight lengths can be used along with Front/Rear and/or Up/Down elbows to fit the customer layout.</li>
                <li>Use the bottom cover plate with 0.635 inch diameter holes for supporting the extension plenum.</li>
                <li>If required, contact the GE factory to order collars that may be installed on the plenum to support the straight extension plenum from the top.</li>
            </ol>
            <p style="margin-top: 15px;">5. Extension plenums are constructed using 12 gauge sheet metal.</p>
            <p>6. Allow a minimum of <span data-field="length_min">{{ length_min }}</span> straight length between turns when designing the layout of the extension plenum.</p>
            <p>7. Customers may install their own version of End duct. Ensure a minimum exhaust area of <span data-field="area_min">{{ area_min }}</span>. Follow local code requirements.</p>
            <p>8. Refer to installation section for assembly of extension plenums.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
